copy     EFI/OC/Kexts/IntelXe.kext (version 9.9.9)
config   Kernel > Add, item 15 (IntelXe.kext): Enabled false -> true
copy     EFI/OC/ACPI/SSDT-ARCOFF.aml (the package's table adapted to this card's port: names \_SB.PCI0.GPP8.UP00.DP40.UP00 instead of \_SB.PC00.PEG1.PEGP)
config   ACPI > Add, item 5 (SSDT-ARCOFF.aml): Enabled false -> true
config   Misc > Security > ExposeSensitiveData: 6 -> 7 (OpenCore then records which EFI it booted from, for this script)
